Z||000000||Springtyme||09-17-2001||10:40 AM||||I think my rotors in my '88 are bad... where can I get some more?!?! Any normal car store? Or is there a better place to get them? At least I hope it's the rotors... Also, how long can I go before it ruins something else in my car? Thanks...<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Springtyme.jpg"> <P>            ~Springtyme~||||reg||5
